{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨日劉穎鏇以空姐造型出席節目巡禮，疑似為經典劇集《衝上雲霄·愛與夢飛行》預熱。她不僅回應了早前籃球賽與譚旻萱爭 …</p><p></p>\n<p>昨日劉穎鏇以空姐造型出席節目巡禮，疑似為經典劇集《衝上雲霄·愛與夢飛行》預熱。她不僅回應了早前籃球賽與譚旻萱爭奪獎項風波，更被發現腿部帶有觸目瘀傷。拍檔張振朗當場踢爆她在球場上隱藏實力，背後更牽涉一項極限秘密企劃。</p>\n<h2>張振朗踢爆拍檔於球場隱藏真正實力</h2>\n<p>針對早前籃球賽大會將獎項頒給譚旻萱，張振朗受訪時替拍檔極度不值，直指劉穎鏇才是真正得分王。他更語出驚人爆料指劉穎鏇當晚根本未盡全力：「我見過佢真正嘅實力！第一次同佢去內地打，佢單場入咗25分，個人獨取全隊最高分！」昨日受訪時，身旁的張振朗亦忍不住直言替她不值，認為Tiffany理應獲頒「得分王」，更大讚她的三分投射能力強勁，是名副其實的「真·籃球女神」，甚至當場向她討教邀約：「打波會唔會預埋我？我要拍片見證佢打波嘅光輝時刻！」面對獎項旁落，Tiffany展現大將之風，淡定表示大會自有計分機制，並力撐對方：「大會係計分嘅，佢（Mandy）助攻真係較多。」展現出極具風度的運動家品格。</p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇恨拍籃球劇</h2>\n<p>對於未來發展，劉穎鏇毫不猶豫許下願望：「入行咁多年，我最期待、最希望發生嘅一件事，就係可以拍一部真正屬於運動、屬於籃球嘅劇集！」因為自己從小到大也是打籃球，覺得運動尤其籃球代表到一種精神，能在球場上展現到有多努力去做一件事。</p>\n<h2>網民逐項與Mandy比拼一面倒「完勝」 Tiffany拒絕落井下石展高EQ</h2>\n<p>除了獎項爭議，網民亦將兩位女神的球場表現逐一抽絲剝繭進行大對比。有網民分析，Tiffany自幼受正規籃球訓練，無論運球走位還是投籃節奏均展現純熟基本功；加上全場掛著招牌「腰果眼」治癒笑容，毫無偶像包袱，人氣瞬間呈幾何級爆發，更有網民形容這場「女神之戰」是由Tiffany大比數勝出。當被傳媒正面問及被網民評為「大比數贏譚旻萱」是否暗自竊喜時，Tiffany絲毫沒有自滿，連忙笑著替對方說好話：「唔好咁講，唔係咁樣嘅，大家喺球場上各方面都有長處。」不落井下石的得體回應，引得身旁的張振朗打趣笑虧她：「佢淡薄名利，唔講呢啲嘢㗎！」</p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇空降巡禮現場驚現觸目瘀傷</h2>\n<p>昨日在西九文化區戲曲中心舉行的《TVB邁向60年節目巡禮2027》上，劉穎鏇未有穿著常規晚裝，反而以一身幹練空姐制服驚喜亮相，瞬間成為全場焦點。外界推測這身造型是為無綫即將開拓微短劇市場中經典IP衍生作《衝上雲霄·愛與夢飛行》打頭陣預熱。現場傳媒敏銳發現她修長雙腿上帶有明顯傷痕，起初眾人猜測是早前在商台籃球賽中與日前對戰Mandy時碰撞受傷有關，Tiffany卻親口揭開謎底——傷痕來自台慶的極限秘密企劃。</p>\n<h2>台慶極限企劃排練致傷展現專業態度</h2>\n<p>關於腿上神秘瘀傷來源，劉穎鏇親口澄清並非球場碰撞所致，而是源於無綫台慶一項極限企劃。她透露目前正與張振朗、朱敏瀚及周嘉洛為台慶重頭演出閉門苦練，旨在向默默耕耘幕後龍虎武師致敬。張振朗表示往後排練全部改為真拳實腿硬橋硬馬真功夫，而劉穎鏇腿上瘀痕正是拳腳無眼下訓練痕跡，她堅定表示純屬小事，更霸氣放話一定會親身上陣。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436775758665912_13578753226af3e10e3ec4b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1794207719_4026427897509001380_193721100.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436775758665912_13578753226af3e10e3ec4b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「真·籃球女神」Tiffany（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436776132175712_11193206136af3e111af205.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1794207719_4026427902147833788_193721100.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436776132175712_11193206136af3e111af205.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>因為籃球賽再引關注（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436776524526800_11434511796af3e1159cbc3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-11 上午11.14.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436776524526800_11434511796af3e1159cbc3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張振朗與Tiffany亦有同場打過波（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17942030995915991_3141283236af15ddc32862.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"拼图_美图设计室 (16).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17942030995915991_3141283236af15ddc32862.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民逐項與Mandy比拼一面倒「完勝」（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436777180046093_1243330946af3e11c3ae0b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"owencheung_1776847869_3880800700100197410_13333304.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179436777180046093_1243330946af3e11c3ae0b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%89%e7%a9%8e%e9%8f%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">劉穎鏇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%8c%af%e6%9c%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張振朗</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%a1%9d%e4%b8%8a%e9%9b%b2%e9%9c%84%e6%84%9b%e8%88%87%e5%a4%a2%e9%a3%9b%e8%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">衝上雲霄愛與夢飛行</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540117\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T04:52:29.519440+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1781,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T03:29:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T05:06:17.716060+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T04:46:04.361115+00:00","content_hash":"9f394e82b0e362d5aa1ad1e7ebd2168ced92d3f44bf9699518cad099e454f0c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}